      "reflection_epoch_shift": "mid exposure time minus Moon-to-HST downleg; downleg interpolated linearly from 1-minute Moon-from-HST DE441 ranges",
      "site_vector_sampling": "Earth/Sun vectors from each selenographic site linearly interpolated at the reflection epoch between 1-minute Horizons samples (Horizons rejects sub-minute steps); interpolation error <~2 km, far below the 150 km probe scale"
